[{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://chat.qwen.ai/?inputFeature=travel","label":"QWEN CHAT","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://chat.qwen.ai/?inputFeature=travel\" label=\"QWEN CHAT\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4","label":"DISCORD","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4\" label=\"DISCORD\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"# Introduction\n\n","depth":1,"text":"Introduction","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Introduction","text":"Introduction","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We are excited to introduce our **brand-new Travel Planning Assistant**, a powerful system built on a **Multi-Agent architecture** with robust  **real-world tool-calling capabilities**. It is designed to handle complex and dynamic itinerary planning tasks with high efficiency. Whether you’re preparing for a multi-city trip or an in-depth single-city exploration, it can deliver precise, actionable travel plans:\n","text":"We are excited to introduce our **brand-new Travel Planning Assistant**, a powerful system built on a **Multi-Agent architecture** with robust  **real-world tool-calling capabilities**. It is designed to handle complex and dynamic itinerary planning tasks with high efficiency. Whether you’re preparing for a multi-city trip or an in-depth single-city exploration, it can deliver precise, actionable travel plans:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We are excited to introduce our ","text":"We are excited to introduce our ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**brand-new Travel Planning Assistant**","text":"brand-new Travel Planning Assistant","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"brand-new Travel Planning Assistant","text":"brand-new Travel Planning Assistant","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", a powerful system built on a ","text":", a powerful system built on a ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multi-Agent architecture**","text":"Multi-Agent architecture","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-Agent architecture","text":"Multi-Agent architecture","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" with robust  ","text":" with robust  ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**real-world tool-calling capabilities**","text":"real-world tool-calling capabilities","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"real-world tool-calling capabilities","text":"real-world tool-calling capabilities","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". It is designed to handle complex and dynamic itinerary planning tasks with high efficiency. Whether you’re preparing for a multi-city trip or an in-depth single-city exploration, it can deliver precise, actionable travel plans:","text":". It is designed to handle complex and dynamic itinerary planning tasks with high efficiency. Whether you’re preparing for a multi-city trip or an in-depth single-city exploration, it can deliver precise, actionable travel plans:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Daily schedules down to the hour**: covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.\n- **Total budget estimates**: plan your expenses in advance.\n- **Important travel reminders**: such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.\n- **Verified real-world data**: all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Daily schedules down to the hour**: covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Daily schedules down to the hour**: covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Daily schedules down to the hour**: covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.","text":"**Daily schedules down to the hour**: covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Daily schedules down to the hour**","text":"Daily schedules down to the hour","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Daily schedules down to the hour","text":"Daily schedules down to the hour","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.","text":": covering transportation, accommodation, attractions, dining, and other key aspects.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Total budget estimates**: plan your expenses in advance.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Total budget estimates**: plan your expenses in advance.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Total budget estimates**: plan your expenses in advance.","text":"**Total budget estimates**: plan your expenses in advance.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Total budget estimates**","text":"Total budget estimates","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Total budget estimates","text":"Total budget estimates","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": plan your expenses in advance.","text":": plan your expenses in advance.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Important travel reminders**: such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Important travel reminders**: such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Important travel reminders**: such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.","text":"**Important travel reminders**: such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Important travel reminders**","text":"Important travel reminders","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Important travel reminders","text":"Important travel reminders","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.","text":": such as weather alerts, attraction regulations, and transportation updates.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Verified real-world data**: all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Verified real-world data**: all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Verified real-world data**: all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","text":"**Verified real-world data**: all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Verified real-world data**","text":"Verified real-world data","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Verified real-world data","text":"Verified real-world data","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","text":": all routes and information are traceable and reliable.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"# Key Features\n\n","depth":1,"text":"Key Features","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features","text":"Key Features","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"## 🧠 Multi-Agent Architecture: Efficient Planning for Complex Trips\n\n","depth":2,"text":"🧠 Multi-Agent Architecture: Efficient Planning for Complex Trips","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"🧠 Multi-Agent Architecture: Efficient Planning for Complex Trips","text":"🧠 Multi-Agent Architecture: Efficient Planning for Complex Trips","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Travel planning is a **systematic task** involving transportation, attractions, lodging, dining, and more — each interconnected and mutually influential.  \nA single agent cannot easily capture this complexity.  ","text":"Travel planning is a **systematic task** involving transportation, attractions, lodging, dining, and more — each interconnected and mutually influential.  \nA single agent cannot easily capture this complexity.  ","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Travel planning is a ","text":"Travel planning is a ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**systematic task**","text":"systematic task","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"systematic task","text":"systematic task","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" involving transportation, attractions, lodging, dining, and more — each interconnected and mutually influential.","text":" involving transportation, attractions, lodging, dining, and more — each interconnected and mutually influential.","escaped":false},{"type":"br","raw":"  \n"},{"type":"text","raw":"A single agent cannot easily capture this complexity.  ","text":"A single agent cannot easily capture this complexity.  ","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"To address this, we built a sophisticated **Multi-Agent collaboration framework** that efficiently manages dynamic interactions among modules.  \nWith intelligent coordination, the system adapts seamlessly to diverse travel scenarios:","text":"To address this, we built a sophisticated **Multi-Agent collaboration framework** that efficiently manages dynamic interactions among modules.  \nWith intelligent coordination, the system adapts seamlessly to diverse travel scenarios:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"To address this, we built a sophisticated ","text":"To address this, we built a sophisticated ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multi-Agent collaboration framework**","text":"Multi-Agent collaboration framework","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-Agent collaboration framework","text":"Multi-Agent collaboration framework","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" that efficiently manages dynamic interactions among modules.","text":" that efficiently manages dynamic interactions among modules.","escaped":false},{"type":"br","raw":"  \n"},{"type":"text","raw":"With intelligent coordination, the system adapts seamlessly to diverse travel scenarios:","text":"With intelligent coordination, the system adapts seamlessly to diverse travel scenarios:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)\n- Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)\n- Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)","text":"Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)","text":"Single-city deep tours (e.g., Beijing)","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)","text":"Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)","text":"Specialized trips at large scenic areas (e.g., Qiandao Lake)","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","text":"Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","text":"Multi-city routes (e.g., the Xinjiang circuit)","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## 🔍 Authenticity: Every Piece of Information is Traceable\n","depth":2,"text":"🔍 Authenticity: Every Piece of Information is Traceable","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"🔍 Authenticity: Every Piece of Information is Traceable","text":"🔍 Authenticity: Every Piece of Information is Traceable","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"The Travel Planning Assistant integrates **real-world third-party tools** (such as Amap, Fliggy and web search) to provide:","text":"The Travel Planning Assistant integrates **real-world third-party tools** (such as Amap, Fliggy and web search) to provide:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"The Travel Planning Assistant integrates ","text":"The Travel Planning Assistant integrates ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**real-world third-party tools**","text":"real-world third-party tools","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"real-world third-party tools","text":"real-world third-party tools","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" (such as Amap, Fliggy and web search) to provide:","text":" (such as Amap, Fliggy and web search) to provide:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.\n- Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.\n- Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.\n- Nearby restaurant recommendations.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.","text":"Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.","text":"Accurate flight, train, hotel, and attraction information.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.","text":"Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.","text":"Real-time traffic updates, attraction opening status, and ticket prices.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.","text":"Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.","text":"Precise calculations of distances and travel durations.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- Nearby restaurant recommendations.","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Nearby restaurant recommendations.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Nearby restaurant recommendations.","text":"Nearby restaurant recommendations.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Nearby restaurant recommendations.","text":"Nearby restaurant recommendations.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"During the generation of a **3-day itinerary**, the system may call tools more than **70 times**, ensuring authenticity and reliability in every plan.","text":"During the generation of a **3-day itinerary**, the system may call tools more than **70 times**, ensuring authenticity and reliability in every plan.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"During the generation of a ","text":"During the generation of a ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**3-day itinerary**","text":"3-day itinerary","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"3-day itinerary","text":"3-day itinerary","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", the system may call tools more than ","text":", the system may call tools more than ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**70 times**","text":"70 times","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"70 times","text":"70 times","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", ensuring authenticity and reliability in every plan.","text":", ensuring authenticity and reliability in every plan.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## 🔁 Outstanding Planning and Reflection Capabilities\n","depth":2,"text":"🔁 Outstanding Planning and Reflection Capabilities","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"🔁 Outstanding Planning and Reflection Capabilities","text":"🔁 Outstanding Planning and Reflection Capabilities","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Powered by the strong **reasoning** and **self-reflection** abilities of the Qwen model, the system not only creates accurate query plans **proactively at the start** but also continuously **validates and optimizes** itineraries during execution.","text":"Powered by the strong **reasoning** and **self-reflection** abilities of the Qwen model, the system not only creates accurate query plans **proactively at the start** but also continuously **validates and optimizes** itineraries during execution.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Powered by the strong ","text":"Powered by the strong ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**reasoning**","text":"reasoning","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"reasoning","text":"reasoning","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" and ","text":" and ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**self-reflection**","text":"self-reflection","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"self-reflection","text":"self-reflection","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" abilities of the Qwen model, the system not only creates accurate query plans ","text":" abilities of the Qwen model, the system not only creates accurate query plans ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**proactively at the start**","text":"proactively at the start","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"proactively at the start","text":"proactively at the start","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" but also continuously ","text":" but also continuously ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**validates and optimizes**","text":"validates and optimizes","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"validates and optimizes","text":"validates and optimizes","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" itineraries during execution.","text":" itineraries during execution.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**Planning Phase**:","text":"**Planning Phase**:","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Planning Phase**","text":"Planning Phase","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Planning Phase","text":"Planning Phase","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":":","text":":","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Predefines query targets according to the type of trip:<ul><li>Transportation methods</li><li>Attraction opening hours</li><li>Routes and distances between sites</li><li>Meal insertion points</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Predefines query targets according to the type of trip:<ul><li>Transportation methods</li><li>Attraction opening hours</li><li>Routes and distances between sites</li><li>Meal insertion points</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**Reflection Phase**:","text":"**Reflection Phase**:","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Reflection Phase**","text":"Reflection Phase","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Reflection Phase","text":"Reflection Phase","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":":","text":":","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Continuously refines the plan based on <strong>real-time data</strong> from sub-agents:<ul><li>Late-night or next-day train arrivals → Automatically adjust attraction order to maximize efficiency.</li><li>Attractions closed on Mondays → Reschedule to another day and optimize the overall route.</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Continuously refines the plan based on <strong>real-time data</strong> from sub-agents:<ul><li>Late-night or next-day train arrivals → Automatically adjust attraction order to maximize efficiency.</li><li>Attractions closed on Mondays → Reschedule to another day and optimize the overall route.</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"# Demo\n\n","depth":1,"text":"Demo","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Demo","text":"Demo","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Demo 1: Qingdao five-day trip\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Demo 1: Qingdao five-day trip","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Demo 1: Qingdao five-day trip","text":"Demo 1: Qingdao five-day trip","escaped":false}]},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_q1.png","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_q1.png\" width=\"80%\" >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_a1.png","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_a1.png\" width=\"80%\" >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Demo 2: Xi'an five-day trip\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Demo 2: Xi'an five-day trip","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Demo 2: Xi'an five-day trip","text":"Demo 2: Xi'an five-day trip","escaped":false}]},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_q2.png","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_q2.png\" width=\"80%\" >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_a2.png","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/qwen-travel-planner/en_a2.png\" width=\"80%\" >}}","tokens":[]}]